#. from tp:gettext-tools-1.0-pre2
msgid "If no output file is given, it depends on the --locale option or the user's\nlocale setting.\nIf the output file already exists, it is merged with the input file,\nas if through '%s'.\nIf it is -, the results are written to standard output.\n"
