msgid "\\bar \".\" now produces a thick barline.\n"
msgstr "\\bar ”.” producerar nu ett tjockt taktstreck.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Dash parameters for slurs and ties are now in 'dash-definition.\n"
msgstr "Streckparametrar för legato- och bindebågar finns nu i ”dash-definition”.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Autobeaming rules have changed.  override-auto-beam-setting and\nrevert-auto-beam-setting have been eliminated.\n\\overrideBeamSettings has been added.\nbeatGrouping has been eliminated.\nDifferent settings for vertical layout.\nly:system-start-text::print -> system-start-text::print\nBeam #'thickness -> Beam #'beam-thickness\nly:note-head::brew-ez-stencil -> note-head::brew-ez-stencil\nly:ambitus::print -> ambitus::print\nExplicit dynamics context definition from `Piano centered dynamics'\ntemplate replaced by new `Dynamics' context."
msgstr "Autobalk-regler har ändrats.  override-auto-beam-setting och\nrevert-auto-beam-setting har tagits bort.\n\\overrideBeamSettings har lagts till.\nbeatGrouping har tagits bort.\nOlika inställningar för vertikal layout.\nly:system-start-text::print -> system-start-text::print\nBeam #'thickness -> Beam #'beam-thickness\nly:note-head::brew-ez-stencil -> note-head::brew-ez-stencil\nly:ambitus::print -> ambitus::print\nExplicit dynamisk kontextdefinition från `Piano centered dynamics'\n-mall ersattes av ny `Dynamics'-kontext."

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "    Autobeam settings are now overriden with \\overrideBeamSettings.\n"
msgstr "    Autobalkinställningar åsidosätts nu med \\overrideBeamSettings.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "    Autobeam settings are now reverted with \\revertBeamSettings.\n"
msgstr "    Autobalkinställningar återställs nu med \\revertBeamSettings.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "    beatGrouping with a specified context must now be accomplished with\n   \\overrideBeamSettings.\n"
msgstr "    beatGrouping med en angiven kontext måste nu göras med\n   \\overrideBeamSettings.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "alignment-offsets has been changed to alignment-distances: you must now specify the distances between staves rather than the offset of staves.\n"
msgstr "alignment-offsets har ändrats till alignment-distances: du måste nu specificera avståndet mellan stavar istället för förskjutningen mellan stavar.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Remove obsolete engravers/translators: Note_swallow_translator,\nRest_swallow_translator, Skip_event_swallow_translator, Swallow_engraver,\nSwallow_performer and String_number_engraver.\nNew vertical spacing variables."
msgstr "Ta bort föråldrade engravers/translators: Note_swallow_translator,\nRest_swallow_translator, Skip_event_swallow_translator, Swallow_engraver,\nSwallow_performer and String_number_engraver.\nNew vertical spacing variables."

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Vertical spacing no longer depends on the Y-extent of a VerticalAxisGroup.\n"
msgstr "Vertikalt utrymme beror inte längre på Y-extent för en VerticalAxisGroup.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Unify fetaNumber and fetaDynamic encodings"
msgstr "Gör fetaNumber- fetaDynamic-kodningar enhetliga"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "\\RemoveEmpty*StaffContext -> \\*Staff \\RemoveEmptyStaves"
msgstr "\\RemoveEmpty*StaffContext -> \\*Staff \\RemoveEmptyStaves"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "\\cresc etc. are now postfix operators"
msgstr "\\cresc etc. är nu postfix-operatorer"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Eliminate beamSettings, beatLength, \\setBeatGrouping, \\overrideBeamSettings and \\revertBeamSettings.\n\"accordion.accEtcbase\" -> \"accordion.etcbass\""
msgstr "Eliminera beamSettings, beatLength, \\setBeatGrouping, \\overrideBeamSettings och \\revertBeamSettings.\n”accordion.accEtcbase” -> ”accordion.etcbass”"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Use \\set beamExceptions or \\overrideTimeSignatureSettings.\n"
msgstr "Använd \\set beamExceptions eller \\overrideTimeSignatureSettings.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Use \\set beamExceptions or \\revertTimeSignatureSettings.\n"
msgstr "Använd \\set beamExceptions eller \\revertTimeSignatureSettings.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Use baseMoment, beatStructure, and beamExceptions.\n"
msgstr "Använd baseMoment, beatStructure, och beamExceptions.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Use baseMoment and beatStructure.\n"
msgstr "Använd baseMoment och beatStructure.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Woodwind diagrams: Move size, thickness, and graphic from argument list to properties.\nDeprecate negative dash-period for hidden lines: use #'style = #'none instead."
msgstr "Woodwind-diagram: Flytta storlek, tjocklek och grafik från argumentlistan till egenskaper.\nFöråldra negativ dash-period för dolda linjer: använd #'style = #'none istället."

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Move size, thickness, and graphic to properties.  Argument should be just the key list.\n"
msgstr "Flytta storlek, tjocklek och grafik till egenskaper. Argumentet ska endast vara tonartslista.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Rename vertical spacing variables.\nAdd fretboard-table argument to savePredefinedFretboard."
msgstr "Byt namn på vertikala utrymmesvariabler.\nLägg till fretboard-table-argument för savePreddefinedFretboard."

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Rename vertical spacing grob properties."
msgstr "Byt namn på egenskaper för vertikal utrymmesgrob."

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Remove \\paper variables head-separation and foot-separation."
msgstr "Ta bort \\paper-variablerna head-separationoch foot-separation."

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Adjust settings for top-system-spacing instead.\n"
msgstr "Justera inställningar för top-system-spacing istället.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Adjust settings for last-bottom-spacing instead.\n"
msgstr "Justera i stället inställningarna för last-bottom-spacing.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Rename space to basic-distance in various spacing alists.\nRemove HarmonicParenthesesItem grob."
msgstr "Ta bort utrymme till basic-distance i olika utrymmes alists.\nTa bort HarmonicParenthesesItem.grob."

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "HarmonicParenthesesItem has been eliminated.\n"
msgstr "HarmonicParenthesesItem har tagits bort.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Harmonic parentheses are part of the TabNoteHead grob.\n"
msgstr "Harmonic parentheses är en del av TabNoteHead-grob.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Remove context from overrideTimeSignatureSettings and revertTimeSignatureSettings.\n"
msgstr "Ta bort kontext från overrideTimeSignatureSettings och revertTimeSignatureSettings.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Change stringTunings from a list of semitones to a list of pitches.\nChange tenor and baritone ukulele names in string tunings.\nGenerate messages for manual conversion of vertical spacing if required."
msgstr "Ändra stringTunings från en lista av halvtoner till en lista av toner.\nÄndra tenor och baritone ukulele-namn i strängstämmningar.\nGenerera meddelande för manuell konvertering för vertikal utrymme om det krävs."

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Vertical spacing changes might affect user-defined contexts."
msgstr "Vertikala utrymmesändringar kan påverka användardefinierade kontext."

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Replace bar-size with bar-extent."
msgstr "Ersätt bar-size med bar-extent."

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Woodwind diagrams: Changes to the clarinet diagram."
msgstr "Woodwind-diagram: Ändringar till klarinettdiagrammet."

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Clarinet fingering changed to reflect actual anatomy of instrument.\n"
msgstr "Klarinettgrepp har ändrats för att motsvara instrumentets faktiska anatomi.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Handling of non-automatic footnotes."
msgstr "Hantering av icke automatiska fotnoter."

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "If you are using non-automatic footnotes, make sure to set footnote-auto-numbering = ##f in the paper block.\n"
msgstr "Om du använder icke automatiska fotnoter, försäkra dig om att ange automatisk numrering av fotnoter = ##f i paper-blocket.\n"

#. from tp:lilypond-2.23.80
msgid "Change in internal property for MultiMeasureRest"
msgstr "Ändring i intern egenskap för MultiMeasureRest"

